<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Dec M2 up 4.1 pct m/m,10.6 pct up y/y.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Dec M2 up 4.1 pct m/m,10.6 pct up y/y.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's M2 money supply rose 4.1 percent in December to 487.9 billion taka after rising 1.5 percent to 468.6 billion in November, central bank officials said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise is 10.6 percent to December, 1996.</p>
<p>					 DEC     NOV     DEC 1995</p>
<p>    M2 money supply (bln taka) 487.9   468.6   440.8</p>
<p>    M1 money supply (bln taka) 141.6   136.7   135.3</p>
</text>
